WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.275
Multiplying is a number of jumps from zero.

2
00:00:04.052 --> 00:00:07.002
Two times three: two jumps of three, to six.

3
00:00:07.828 --> 00:00:12.103
Two times negative three: two jumps to the left, to negative six.

4
00:00:21.621 --> 00:00:25.396
Negative two jumps go the opposite way: positive six.
